          "to": "Prakrit 𑀡𑀸𑀳 ṇāha",
          "note": "Sauraseni has 𑀡𑀸𑀥 ṇādha with voicing instead."
        },
        {
          "from": "Sanskrit रथ ratha 'chariot'",
